<title>UK: Ex-dividends to take 4.062 pts off FTSE on Nov 11.</title>
<headline>Ex-dividends to take 4.062 pts off FTSE on Nov 11.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following FTSE-100 stocks will trade ex-dividend on November 11. Analysts estimate this will take 4.062 points off the FTSE 100.</p>
<p>				   DIVIDEND	INDEX</p>
<p>				   (PENCE)	 EFFECT</p>
<p>COMPANY			  Net   Gross    Gross</p>
<p>* British Petroleum	  5.00  6.250   2.065</p>
<p>* Marks &amp; Spencer	    3.30  4.125   0.682</p>
<p>* Pilkington Plc	     1.75  2.188   0.132</p>
<p>* J. Sainsbury		 3.50  4.375   0.470</p>
<p>* SmithKline Beecham	 3.56  4.450   0.714</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 542 4027</p>
</text>
